            "html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"misto\" class=\"wrap tk-s-7e3eae42\">\n<div class=\"sec-head\"><h2 id=\"misto\" class=\"h2\">Kde cvičíme: <span class=\"serif\">Praha 4 a Zlín</span></h2></div>\n<div class=\"grid tk-s-ebb546d6\">\n<div class=\"card stack reveal tk-s-9a49f57a\">\n<div data-tk-map-box data-src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Jeremenkova%201003%2F66A%2C%20Praha%204&amp;t=m&amp;z=16&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near\" data-title=\"Mapa – Tělocvična ZŠ Jeremenkova, Jeremenkova 1003/66A, Praha 4\" class=\"tk-map tk-s-d31be0a1\">\n<span class=\"tk-map-pin\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5a7 7 0 0 1 14 0C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></circle></svg></span>\n<button type=\"button\" data-tk-map class=\"btn btn-jade btn-sm\">Zobrazit mapu</button>\n<span class=\"small muted tk-map-note\">Mapu načteme od Google až po kliknutí. <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Jeremenkova%201003%2F66A%2C%20Praha%204\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"lnk tk-map-link\">Otevřít v Google Maps</a></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stack tk-s-13fa9231\"><strong class=\"tk-s-501a067d\">Tělocvična ZŠ Jeremenkova</strong><span class=\"small muted\">Jeremenkova 1003/66A</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card stack reveal tk-s-9a49f57a\">\n<div data-tk-map-box data-src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Osvoboditel%C5%AF%20484%2C%20Zl%C3%ADn&amp;t=m&amp;z=16&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near\" data-title=\"Mapa – Centrum Jiný svět, Osvoboditelů 484, Zlín\" class=\"tk-map tk-s-d31be0a1\">\n<span class=\"tk-map-pin\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5a7 7 0 0 1 14 0C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\